  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f34024019c2b5388e918baf3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "行程一定要严格执行哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7c9393d173c205299c23da1007c21a212b035c88a95ed73c51c67cb1f6111cae",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "70000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bb0c40e02503bad33bab0de0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你说你一开始\r\n就注定会成为我的训练员……\r\n说不定……真的是这样呢，呵呵。",
      "source_fingerprint": "895d57d91d2e5631b5f985d73082bf9d3795ef8a490cfbc9875f695773ed23e6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "70001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4066dc23f731d6009a7f6845",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我希望能有维持学园传统的自觉。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7c153c40e55f6d47afff8e6e121a89502ddae2d9e83217e8a34e544a19869a11",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "70004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:55705266cf80bc93018a2617",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我在舞台上的模样，\r\n真想让父母也看到。",
      "source_fingerprint": "63614dde427996783e7c806f2ab966f32275ebd281a86939ea7d881a65d6da1a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "70008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dfa992b477a0cc53b1db1fa9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我觉得很自豪也充满了勇气呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "20de57d6c767286b3236a4722976bdbb24d3f8d373fc1a6cf35c3c33d62921d5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "70009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:94fbd87c6e22ec9bec08da6a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "兼顾学业和比赛……\r\n这是学生应该做到的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9ec645797eb54e51b4dd4029ac656cc65039a208653de32f46b7242b69aaf144",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "70010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fd3ccec107ba1e33c0175c8b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Live的训练，\r\n我会确实安排在行程中的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bd43296cf4b6b4824b21d9d9168fd96f9480c2aa99d7ec4f2565f25fe9589e91",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "70014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9efb38701392872b8993c6ac",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "尺寸非常完美。\r\n没有半分的差错。",
      "source_fingerprint": "06f198db714dc5ad562a8162fb2d7b29d3e079526e16ec29769c57b2964907c7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "70015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e86ee1230669590625bff9e0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "让我回想起父母站在厨房的样子呢……",
      "source_fingerprint": "0737357a0b5c439fa6222e763238e3247951e82f9b29cfa6f665fa7be81cf5c7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "70016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:00e941ec01694725844e9ce0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "小时候向往穿上的衣服……\r\n感觉好像在做梦一样。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8ee0c1b5e66015c39a6b5b5e8905ee7aa6b006a4e584ce8e472d0fccdb459439",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "70017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ce6a2cd4c9e94b87e7d12fed",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "太了不起了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "62f4616a29f991416c2cf3a7564d4fa75d3ed9c3dfb368429cb9ddbdb7d390d2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "70018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7d08847ad14f05abc23dffd8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我会分毫不差地取得胜利！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6c308041e8ced9dc0e6bf8bd2da385d50bc1a05b792836fa11220a2ddde4e3b6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "70019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:852133f5768b99222962b314",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ここからはプライベート用の\r\nスケジュールに移行します。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0f50d8decc75aed5097cde641fca1d1efcbaaaddba87f9c4c7bfb1d87d4c379d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "70020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:53d6be909d3982ed478e2952",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "私的な時間ではありますが、変わらず、\r\n身も心も引き締めていきましょう。",
      "source_fingerprint": "554132c4f339b3cb46111987b3767daa1b0c7740d601356800d43eafccecbee9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "70021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:af3eee2527a851b9945fba34",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ファルコンさんが選んでくれたのですが、\r\n少し大胆でしょうか…？",
      "source_fingerprint": "6d40b323250ca8fc987c3b8a75686bbd053cfa1ba2c55f7aac54b7fb5ba57b81",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "70216"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fe253e64e44b043d3224de7e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "心なしか、聞こえます。\r\n潮騒の音色が…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7a4b1c42513d0d41f8e4ff2a727b27b258ecc6f05fee4b8f0b2829c80305fae3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "70217"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:25e67d6896c2f0c445684fd3",
