      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aa56a050c503f628e9e31057",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "心なしか、聞こえます。\r\n潮騒の音色が…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7a4b1c42513d0d41f8e4ff2a727b27b258ecc6f05fee4b8f0b2829c80305fae3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "71217"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2ef56a0e8e2abf6ff73acd29",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "辛苦了",
      "source_fingerprint": "bd96bf364b8b21a3bb94efcf4ef82feb1bc34cf02203524e7949dbd19151dd13",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "80000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0f1b3ce2a2957ca870c06772",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "让我见识一下……\r\n你锻炼出的成果吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7392063793239316e207eb3e38ffe5c5d9b90d823b2eb89611f5f8ebba0b3944",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "81000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e0a753b656b774b12a83a229",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "赌上彼此的荣誉……\r\n堂堂正正地一决胜负。",
      "source_fingerprint": "996cdcfbf461d6871052575c802e1ff1fa68b1fc26491b674eb767c3f3a651b0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "81001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7fd89eca9858458a0683543d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Guten Morgen。\r\n早上总是很容易手忙脚乱的呢。\r\n前一晚的事前准备是很重要的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bd7b5e04033bfa8e687f3a33f3942aefd6259eec4d03532f5e6e54d4cfe01101",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "90000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ce99908189221aa628000c23",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "说到日本的早餐……\r\n就会想到纳豆呢。\r\n我非常喜欢吃喔。",
      "source_fingerprint": "438b691646e1d8aa34fda1b0d621235ef66d45ecedbf92d1e05620fca8cc86e1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "90001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1baf6cc78562991f4fbf643a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要在25分30秒内用餐完毕，\r\n然后开始复习……啊，糟糕，\r\n约好了要和飞鹰一起用餐的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d96b7d25e3032a879475475694b886c3a5aaaa3f8517ddaddd17dce0673be2f2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "90002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:69ed2b9da343e4efd6b88454",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……每天八秒。\r\n那是我花在用来确认食堂\r\n有没有推出新甜点的时间。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6fc4d7b0a7ae9c75e0e7c0bd65d2ebd8a0dbf104fbc833d905770ed7831bb9ea",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "90003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ce215039af0b20e2103fda1b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "确认行程四分钟、\r\n想念家人或朋友五分钟……\r\n我都这样有效利用睡前的时间。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e48ca3463ac2b93c7f404b6ec4d8eb6f681bba611769cc94f6a323fbf2dbdf84",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "90004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:60b28a26cbd0d00db6442140",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天也要结束了呢……\r\n要进行今日反省和安排明天的行程，\r\n做好迎接未来的准备。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a120d7000ca30ec5edbc85d4c0a3b83c114f97469d96876a4643b533c30a9fcf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "90005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0fd7e5579e57e323f2af8d81",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "从以前我就对春天的花朵怀有敬意。\r\n因为它们每年都能忍过寒冬，\r\n准时在春天绽放……很值得钦佩。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cbb3c0b271412ac4317b63828f5124a36439ea0421a4ea8da9b6c83bf1479292",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "90006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eafbbc35c77d8d75819a4d5d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "因为随时都会有中暑的风险，\r\n所以一定要做好补充水分的行程表，\r\n也要记得携带自己的水壶。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c91f755caa54ca477fc7c97482f9a55743fb38218991b95a3592c20c0f36c465",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "90007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4b2d842856de61e8669babe5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "说到德国的秋天……\r\n果然还是会想到慕尼黑啤酒节。\r\n希望有机会可以招待你参加呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2b34e9bc074f3e87a27dd0f0e0e19ea0bfcfa2ed9cfdf48b6b8b60f92bd92e1b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "90008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a6b14760cdaa3e81a66f3e62",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "冬天就是会不小心长时间待在室内。\r\n……趁这时候来开发新蛋糕好了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "27eeda98939ba2936ebcfd8eaeb3d95ec6b565a67920933d604269cb12a28d6f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "90009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f256835cd6fdf779187397c6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "早安。\r\n请一起念出开启一天的咒语吧。\r\n……Ich gebe mein Bestes!",
      "source_fingerprint": "19be8a308cbc51681dea259f56816938a9ca4fad13ce1156c4b0528f3c668e29",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "90010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2454f5d69bb7ff677e0e33eb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "每次和大家打招呼时，\r\n都会被说有股很香的味道……\r\n原因是我早上烤的饼干吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0ac8e4792f1591d2ee013fca8ae98f476a6f0de4de48259f118ad3df109f535e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "90011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d9eb4c9a89ef82abd5657f36",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "摄取糖分能增添下午的活力。\r\n只不过，\r\n必须要有计划地摄取才行……",
      "source_fingerprint": "4d114636e83dbb9ecc0e3f9d5101b92d606396cf4115d819eba1247e9d561b97",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "90012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0f1c7061dbd78ac010f5c8ba",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "再怎么忙也一定要休息。\r\n父亲说过，\r\n这是能将工作做好的秘诀。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0a454a681cc2f9df396af9a735764dbd553e08617882cf513c5d174f6c1dc06b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "90013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eb21227eee82a825eb267b0d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这个时间禁止吃点心。\r\n就算再怎么想吃，\r\n也要忍到明天……才可以喔。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2e5984199b3696d603a21ef5fc08dbb385641d98b80e4deb65d4e411fd684c78",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "90014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e73a0bbe44af5ec2f0c651a4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "做好面糊的准备了。接下来\r\n就是放在冰箱静置12小时……\r\n呵呵，还请好好期待吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4bac1b2ae2f16f0db89375e09536c88a511c79d12822ea84837b44cda12bf64c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "90015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:55adac3c2fbce54bcc6264cd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "看见樱花就会让我想起\r\n和父母一起赏花的回忆……呵呵，\r\n其实德国也有一整排的樱花树喔。",
      "source_fingerprint": "dee9de3f69f77c2ebba4e3c5792c710f16604c3c12943b65dd63f9d1600221a7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "90016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2da4f921a9aee7027e89feee",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今年也开始变热了呢……\r\n不过还请放心，\r\n我有做了冰蛋糕Kalter Hund。",
      "source_fingerprint": "379b5ac4c4abebc8f7b6a59b12a126791e33de50ee2cf2b69a64e201d2dcbc9a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "90017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0447840a9f60233db0644404",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我最近在尽可能地做些\r\n低热量的点心。毕竟是食欲之秋，\r\n得确实做好管理才行。",
      "source_fingerprint": "85077e27aca9d955f291777edc3e4b4eb3c5859b82e5ca0038ac9796cbc91187",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "90018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4663ca80955184a31e1f0978",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "点心基本上都是冷却后食用，\r\n不过吃了就会感受到温暖……\r\n真的是很不可思议呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "241200c5430fabda8905c495adfff4a50acb1de238921a3bca90db4f4010b4b4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "90019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5aaa6c0cad9454b465e07f0e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "情人节快乐",
      "source_fingerprint": "9392c70765a5a96081978bc15cd29abd7d78628fdd8840f21389130a9a70469b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "90020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bba35c113ed8fbb5e0c7475a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "情人节快乐",
      "source_fingerprint": "9392c70765a5a96081978bc15cd29abd7d78628fdd8840f21389130a9a70469b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "90021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e1a376e018187acd3dc5aad8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "日光は適切に浴びられていますか？\r\n充実した1日は、体内時計の\r\nリセットから始まるものですよ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "244ee5bdff6436f746a41470041ebb43231229de0c53f8ff3e01dd04221946ec",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "90210"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6353a52125d2e15648a12631",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "毎朝、ランニングで決まった時間に\r\nお会いして…ドゥラメンテさんも\r\n時間に正確な方なのでしょうか。",
      "source_fingerprint": "42347b4439a5401b7cc3c80f9dfa25106c98bf7aab1aadadcf165a59d5109c1f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "90211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f4801cc038c5132cb4853e7c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "世界には水中サッカーなる\r\n競技があるそうですが…。\r\n特訓に活かせないでしょうか？",
      "source_fingerprint": "c57a54889f96c76edf734d08ba90ced995d44ba0e17f57e092d3ff1e62a82699",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "90212"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e8db3ec21fe5167e611371c8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "冷蔵庫で冷やしているんです、\r\n手作りのスパゲッティアイス。\r\nどんな味かはお楽しみ…ですよ？",
      "source_fingerprint": "eefb5ab4a312e651ff97be5bc8d240f1a6e606be791e7fb9716e4fbb4a4605b8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "90213"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:014aea8dc61a339543ba8fef",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ドイツには、天国に行けない鬼火の\r\nお話があります。…幼い頃は怖いと\r\nいうより、悲しく感じました。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d4a1ae940f5716fd3313954f54e0fa0252d75a26753568ee6d0d9550666a03ea",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "90214"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:72da908c0e3a943e80fccaf2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "夜はRuhezeit…安静時間です。\r\n皆さんがゆっくり休めるよう、\r\n静かに過ごしましょう。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a506da20870c3d7c955bab23d791a6374eee26dc3e8d0acc3975cefadc36c3df",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "90215"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a7ee1e7d8af7cc02cbf30641",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Spargel…白アスパラガスが\r\n美味しい季節ですね。あの甘みを\r\n味わうと、春の訪れを感じます。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f436e8d87fdaa899e2f05745137a77d119f7b521fabeaadce91e938e4ba35b5e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "90216"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2daad38c97178fe63d53e6f6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "クーラーの涼しさには少し慣れない\r\nですね。ドイツでは扇風機が\r\n一般的、でし、て…くちゅんっ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "232c93398e30e9a8483db1fc188c18400d7aa365bd1c8689bb728c51fae550b1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "90217"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7a66c10c7b850400e9e4cc71",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ご一緒に映画鑑賞はいかがですか？\r\nこの季節、情緒的な余韻が残る\r\nしっとりとした作品がおすすめです。",
      "source_fingerprint": "700a341c33ca0503cc374c7d851ea7084ca77e5db242c1e8ed6c1427e11d2f95",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "90218"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f58db77a8b91eefd10bb2f7e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "日本にも水着で入れる入浴施設が\r\nあるんですよね？健康促進のため、\r\n通えればと思いまして。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a4a35b47e630eb94da64ab13b3606cb72ddec6891e3bacddaeaad48ef3631820",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "90219"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6c3dcd1b1bb85e2cd629ea6b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ハッピーバレンタイン",
      "source_fingerprint": "205aa64f55aa5b5868c584cadc0b5dcd8e05b84b0a76c8efb1da86986277c562",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "90221"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2f84676b31871974ee53ea6b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我跟着节拍器在哼歌的时候，\r\n飞鹰突然从背后出现……\r\n害我不小心吓得叫了出来……",
      "source_fingerprint": "fdc5206135474a1270baefe1bd57db96173ca9e416e8d6f35e9afb582d8018c1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "91000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f252df3eb6977ca2fbf5557a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "可以轻松维持和那么多人的友谊……\r\n佐敦或许很擅长安排时间呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1b9f4078590431505b6d5b2377811c41668d2700eec434e29aa8dd4969bf6b08",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "91001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e1ea86913dd88dd7f01f5981",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然中山对胜负的态度和我相反。\r\n但也因为如此，\r\n才让我觉得有值得学习的空间。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ee0df6196f030d1669a8375db1b90a580b236f056fa6f1483df588a5f830e5ed",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "91002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0092e75902e1f44b2d4bf9a2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我和黄金船约好要一起逛蛋糕店……\r\n但不知不觉间，\r\n就变成古早味零食一把抓之旅了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5b5a32a85d0c3e819b4a2f397865e935467e6cedf54b47caa5e72c31587112ef",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "91003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:57310e29283b26232c82817d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我喜欢看电影，但唯独僵尸片……\r\n已经腐烂的尸体怎么可能那样动呢？\r\n太奇怪了……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cb4e7ae9ec219d6a83aee022905ec1c13d692d040c82bfec1aa5a6a5c87d0ecb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "91004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bc5645bbae8a5fd621f3b3ab",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "每一个过程都要完美……\r\n这样才不辜负观众对我的期望，\r\n也不会对一起奔跑的对手失礼。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f14011e8145d00fa9a9611e49581405de8d6d9708ae5830a1492fa644070fd18",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "91005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:63056a3aa890393290023544",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我原本就是喜欢嘉年华的人。\r\n想到能穿这套衣服跳舞，\r\n我就满心期待呢，呵呵。",
      "source_fingerprint": "31184a1db6c3c875b51b46f5460359f1912c751f21a6ad0bb4c745c22641ad59",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "91006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8aafcc1886c9bdeb2388c6bb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "柔软蓬松却又耐得住激烈动作……\r\n真的是很棒的一套服装。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fd57c8bbd4f8101ce1d237eb28b41e843af83e6dab8ce645cc05a01e0c9f6303",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "91007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f82766397ec5b29085231d03",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "量身打造的完美比例……\r\n为我制作这套服装的师傅，\r\n技术实在令人佩服。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2095601685fafec6c26803cf0f7886d8e1aea1fb1d16a800b9dd0908cfb4226b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "91008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ca2eb6e4c26f64d3baf48296",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "开店前弥漫着甜点刚出炉的香气……\r\n有时候我也会觉得很想家呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c21ef0316bd116a0f9a15cb8d64cb32994de3fd9f9aa812cd7dbfc2506df4c56",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "91009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:95f1687ebc03460166c348ef",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "在德国，午餐是一天三餐的重点。\r\n我现在也没有改变这个习惯。\r\n在运动方面来说这也是合理的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e13cc2c5942cd0ef4a106232406ab6f484630df1f86ca36f2914fdd34150bb07",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "91010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:483c2bc3aa7c90e2afe65dda",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "如果有能以秒为单位进行设定的\r\n闹钟就好了……但说到底，\r\n最可靠的或许还是生理时钟吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "73bf92c5a185897f763eddf8ee3a047d585a2158d10ee1f855ccf3a90b493aca",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "91011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7facff165bd26730b65284fb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "又来到了能看见瓢虫的季节了。\r\n……瓢虫真的是很可爱呢……",
      "source_fingerprint": "7448872624e64f929fbad56842d6266635a29a6e42b749e3181aafb8007f18e5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "91012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fe6306e276e5710b518ae43d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "真的是很热呢……\r\n虽然其实更想去湖泊，\r\n但我就在游泳池凉快一下好了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a50ca3277c2b58a9e3ca6ca270e54b8bb49d60e6bc18c04062c8e3de3c6776ac",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "91013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:822ce41d369d692ef17e4cc5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "运动之秋吗？\r\n那我……想要踢足球呢。\r\n可以的话，希望你能陪我一起。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2173eeac6efbe4cce2939c8dba6e44ace65b6a6a768efed3578159240a4ba64a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "91014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:328bb8d7639723ff26a636b8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "下雪时就会想起德式圣诞蛋糕……\r\n每到了圣诞节，\r\n我都会帮忙一起做喔。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e03bf986f1bc62fe19f285b88d487dae96195ba9c2ae4c2b20e75f4a74e24fd3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1037",
        "91015"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
